#: kopi_coffee/second_affogato_question/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drowned."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_affogato_question/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drizzled."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_affogato_question/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dropped."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_affogato_question/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Yes, that's right! Affogato means 'drowned'."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_affogato_question/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Might be morbid... but I like it!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/irish_quiz/0/b/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Alright... you've had the Irish coffee a few times now."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/irish_quiz/0/b/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Assuming you're not completely gone from the booze... pop quiz!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/first_irish_question/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Why do you need to use Irish whiskey while making an Irish coffee?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/first_irish_question/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's more sour."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/first_irish_question/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's more smoky and spicy."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/first_irish_question/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's smoother with hints of vanilla."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/first_irish_question/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "T-That's right!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/first_irish_question/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It IS smoother, and does have hints of vanilla in the taste... to bring out the tones of the coffee!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_irish_question/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "What do you pour over an Irish coffee?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_irish_question/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thick cream."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_irish_question/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Condensed milk."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_irish_question/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thick foam."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/second_irish_question/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You're on the ball! Yup, to make an Irish coffee, you pour whiskey and sugar over black coffee, stir it up a little bit, and then pour some thick cream over it!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi beams at you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/14
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm happy you remembered!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/25
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Anyways, thanks for taking my little quiz!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure thing!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, okay? I'm just here for the coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Stay caffeinated!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_correct/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Ah, right."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_wrong/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi frowns, disappointment evident in her expression."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_wrong/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No... that's not it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_wrong/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You really haven't been paying attention to what I've been saying... have you?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/answer_wrong/27
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I suppose I'll see you next time, then..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi places both palms on the counter, leaning over to glare at you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Alright, what's the deal?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/21/s/0 kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You keep on coming in here on multiple days... getting NOTHING to drink."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/5
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Why do you even come in here, if you're NOT getting coffee?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like coming in to see you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Look, I'm doing a JOB here."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You can't keep coming in here to waste my time and loiter around."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "This kind of behavior is lowkey creepy."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I'm going to have to permanently ban you from Roofbucks."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/42
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "We won't be seeing you again."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/81
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Teehee - just creepily coming in to say hi, and ordering nothing?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_reject_choice/0/g-0/c-1/89
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "One-way-ticket to Weirdoville!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_double_reject/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Again? Seriously??"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_double_reject/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No. Just no."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/coffee_double_reject/19
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Next time you come in I'm calling security."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Listen... I need to talk to you about something."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm all ears."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's just... you've been coming here so often..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I visit to see you, what's wrong with that?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've loved hearing you talk about coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Well... that's the thing."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I feel like you've ONLY been visiting me just to hear me... rant on about my little coffee facts, but I wonder sometimes if you're really listening."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Do you like what I have to say?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It can be hard to remember some stuff, but I enjoy hearing you talk."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know I'm listening! I got your answers right, didn't I?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not at all. Service workers should stick to their jobs."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Well... I can't be too hard on you, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/15 kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You're a good customer, and I'm glad to know you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-0/26 kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/29 kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You're right!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/31/c-2/60
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Yeah! Everyone has a job - and yours is to cause chaos!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm... I'm glad!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I've definitely seen just how much you've come in to chat and learn it all."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Like... WOAH. You've definitely absorbed a LOT since we started talking."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You're a really attentive customer."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's been an honour learning from you!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Same with you, honestly!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "If it weren't for you... I don't think I'd be able to improve my coffee the same way!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You've definitely helped me warm up my skills!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You certainly make some stellar coffee!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And you've helped me warm up my heart."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe... you could warm me at night."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're... uh... you make me warm."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping that we could be more than that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Seriously... Thanks so much."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/weighty_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/48/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'll see you the next time you come down to Roofbucks!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_1/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Gosh... you're really sure about this?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_1/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've brewed up love in my heart."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "<i>chuckles</i> So I see."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_1/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "We'll see how this goes, then. Feel free to stop by any time."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_2/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You mean, like..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_2/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh... Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_2/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Gosh... I never expected this, but..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_2/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Why not give it a go!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_2/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm willing to try it if you are!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_2/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Stop by any time..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_3/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_3/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'll take that as a confession, haha!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_3/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I might be interested. Give me some time to let this relationship brew."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_4/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Well... I'm certainly not opposed to it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/love_path_4/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Stop by any time you like. Let's allow this relationship to brew some more."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_friend_joiner/0 kopi_coffee/kopi_love_joiner/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi, with you as her right hand, thrives in the coffee business."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_friend_joiner/8 kopi_coffee/kopi_love_joiner/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Under her leadership, the house's coffee has never been better. Customers are satisfied, and have started to take a keen liking to chatting away with Kopi."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_friend_joiner/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And you are not her only new friend; she's becoming fast friends with everybody she meets."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_friend_joiner/24 kopi_coffee/kopi_love_joiner/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without the shackles of corporate greed over her, she is the go-to spot for anybody looking to get a nice warm reception."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_friend_joiner/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's doing what she loves, and has a great friend to get through the tough times with."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_love_joiner/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Your love and support has shaped her new perspective on life, and coffee. She insisted all of her new drinks be dedicated to you, with your name adorned on the menu."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_love_joiner/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's happy to have you right by her side, eagerly awaiting for you to try her next cup of coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Hi love!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How's work today, brewtiful?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/12/s/0 kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, Kopi, I am ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Heh, I love it when you call me that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Work has been a little slow today, but, it's all worth it to see all the smiles from happy customers!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Seriously, love, if it wasn't for you, I'd still be under the corporate machine."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "How can I warm up my special little brew?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/42/1/s/0 kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just wanted to say hi!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_lovereturn/0/c-0/42/c-1/7 kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Aw... thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Heya, friendo! Glad to see you again."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Now, I'm still thinking of names to call my cafe."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Kopi's Coffee... Kopi's Kopi... Coffee's Kopi..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm... yeah I'm still workshopping it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/35
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Anyways, what can I getcha?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_friendshipreturn/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want a drink!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Welcome to Roofbucks. The home of all your coffee needs..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Then again, it's not like you have any real coffee needs."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I told you before."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You're. Banned."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, I've changed my ways! (USE CHARM CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Get lost."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I realize I wasn't listening to you truly. But I've learned."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "All right. Might as well try this again."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_coffee_hatereturn/0/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Next time you come in I'll treat you like any other customer."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_double_hate_return/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Welcome to-"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_double_hate_return/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, for pete's sake."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_double_hate_return/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Security!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_double_hate_return/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You leave before they can forcibly take you away."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Wait... really?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I can go do whatever I want?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_join/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, and I have what you need to do it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_join/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, but I'm not ready just yet."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, okay! Lemme know and circle back to me, all right?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh hey! Welcome back!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "So, we doing this... or...?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, we're doing this!."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, still not yet."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No problem!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I guess I'll just be waiting here."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_return/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...waiting...."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "We're starting Realization with Kopi... she's so supportive it's bound to work."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Rise 'n grind, Kopi!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realize_begin/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a coffee-maker, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Welcome...."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "To..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Humanbucks???"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi bristles with energy - her ability to make coffee has increased a thousandfold; what with having actual fingers."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/35
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Okay - what can I get you?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You... don't have to get me anything."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A kiss?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Is that some kind of drink?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, Kopi, kiss me!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, the kind of drink where you put your lips on mine."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi stands... shocked. She never figured herself the kissing type. Not the least because she hasn't had lips for very long."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...ohkay..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Extra sweetener?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know it!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, you're sweet enough already."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her kiss tastes of mint, the sweet aroma of freshly ground coffee beans tickling your senses."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's hot."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Piping hot."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/27
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/35
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But... you can always blow on me to cool me down."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/c-1/15/g-0/24/g-0/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi holds your hands in hers."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks deep into your eyes, searching for some sign that all of this is real."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Do you mean it? I don't have to work in coffee anymore? Take orders? Nothing like that?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not if you don't want to."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're free, Kopi."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But I still like helping others. And spreading knowledge about coffee..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Maybe I could open a shop of my own..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "One free from multinational corporations."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi searches the world for the best place to make a small shop - one where she can serve coffee slowly, getting to know all the customers who come by."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/43/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Although she's still shell-shocked if any friars walk in."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A haven for coffee and a relaxing life, Kopi finds herself in the laneways of Melbourne, Australia."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Plus, her accent fits right in anyway."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/62
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Welcome to SiterBucks!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Yes, with the walls full of the sound of the Indonesian instrument the siter, Kopi has found a way to rebrand Roofbucks with a name that doesn't sound like anything else, while paying homage to Southeast Asian culture."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_realized/0/g-1/75
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The coffee is poured extra-slowly, and the conversations are extra-long. Customers who come and visit are treated to education and elucidation on bean provenance and preparation."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi is for once, not busying herself making coffee when you see her. She rests her head on her hand, staring off into the distance."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uhh, Kopi?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She starts, lifting her head from her hand."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh! Sorry, hey, good to see you!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Anything I can get for you today?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why were you just staring off into space?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Where's your usual greeting?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, well, uh, it's kinda just what I do every now and then."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Sorry! I was... distracted."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Most of the time when I don't have customers, I'm kinda just expected to do busy work. Y'know..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "\"If there's time to lean, there's time to clean!\""
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But, like, a lot of the time there's pretty much just nothing else to do, so I just... dissociate."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I guess it helps me deal with the business behind the scenes."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't imagine the kinds of things you have to deal with."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must hate your job."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You can. It involves cleaning, mostly."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's not that I don't like my job. I love my job."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But... I think Roofbucks expects me to be all smiles, all the time."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They give you orders like some sort of royalty?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do they ever come around?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-2/c-5/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "The owner does."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "The owner is never around. He just likes being outside of everything that involves boots on the ground..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's like... I can only do so much, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Especially when I'm scheduled to have long, grueling shifts."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's always a pain, but, gotta do what I can for the corporate machine!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's a... strange existence, if I'm being honest."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Working every day for a company that wouldn't bat an eye if I went away."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "They'd just replace me with a newer, younger barista that's got skills I wouldn't even dream of."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I think there's some baristas out there that can make whole drinks in like... 30 seconds flat, and all they have to do is just tap some setting in their brain to get going."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/56
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Me? I like to take my time with drinks."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/64
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Really make sure that the milk in my hands is at the perfect temperature by really feeling it... y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-3/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn't that wear you out?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, big time, but I'll never let customers see it on my face."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Is it unhealthy? Probably."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Will I take steps to fix it? Probably not."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I just gotta make sure I'm on my game, otherwise I'd be tempted to drink a bit of coffee during the night shift."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong with getting coffee at night?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll never get coffee at night, so I'm not interested."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/c-8/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I mean, look, I would never deny myself the taste of a good coffee, and I would love to drink it anytime I pleased, but not at night."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/c-8/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I don't know if it's just caffeine induced psychosis, or whatever, but you'll get nightmares. Guaranteed."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-4/c-9/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Phew, well, that's a relief."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But, yeah, I pretty much get worked to the bone here. Day and night. So, sometimes I just tune out a bit."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Do NOT get me wrong, I do love my job. I couldn't just NOT make coffee; it's my life, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "And, it's what I'm made for. These hands are as steady as an arabica!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "... Which isn't to say much because they sway pretty badly in the breeze."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/35
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Gosh, sorry, feels like I'm rambling again..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I'll have to report you to the manager!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're cute when you ramble."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/c-10/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Ahahaha! Ahahaha... haha..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/c-10/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Funny, but, gosh, don't even JOKE about that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/c-11/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-5/c-11/26
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "If only the manager felt that way."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "The owner is SUPER particular about the way I do customer service."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "We differ in that aspect a LOT I guess, but, gotta do whatever I can to help keep the lights on."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It'd be nice if he actually took the time to LEARN about coffee, like you did."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I had a perfect blend of intelligence and looks teaching me."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He probably just doesn't understand the importance of coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/c-12/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh... stop... !"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/c-12/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I don't think I was THAT good of a teacher, but... you do know how to flatter a girl."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-6/c-13/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Don't I know it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It is what it is, I guess. But hey, at least I get to see my favorite regular!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_1/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Thanks for the chat, seriously. We need to talk more soon!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi greets you robotically, lifting her hand to give you a stiff wave. Her gaze looks vacant and her words are cold and empty."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/14
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Welcome back! To Roofbucks!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/22
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Home of all your coffee needs..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell is going on?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm going to just ignore this."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Whatever do you mean, oh fine customer?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Try your best... but it'll always get to ya."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Roofbucks wants to ensure you have a consistent and standardized greeting, so that whenever you come to our store, you know that you are getting the best service every time..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...and your continued patronage is appreciated..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi trails off, leaning forward in a sigh that seems to make her entire body droop."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...yeah, I can't do that anymore."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That was... weird."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But we know each other well now."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I know, I know. Roofbucks wants people to add the \"Roofbucks\" touch every single time we greet customers."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Yeah, even though you're a regular here, apparently I can't get \"too\" friendly with customers by dropping the formalities."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "So they're just making me sound like... a monotone robot."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Take me... to your leader."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds... like a handful."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...PFF-!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-4/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Alright, alright, you get that one."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You have no idea."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I... wait, was that supposed to be a pun?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/26
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No... what am I saying?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/37
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm sorry, yeah, I'm definitely overthinking that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/45
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Sorry, sometimes when I'm blowing off steam it feels like I'm going a million miles a minute."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're doing great!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-1/c-5/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Must be all that coffee..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But it sucks, too... I feel like every coffee I make for somebody, I learn a little bit more about them. Get to know what they're like."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Like you, for instance. You're..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Well, I don't really have words for it..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Friendly?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Sorry, my mind is drawing a blank. Sometimes when we talk, I feel a little out of my depth."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could say the same for the barista making my drinks."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friendly sounds about right."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Is... that a good thing or a bad thing?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/c-6/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "How would you describe me then?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/c-6/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're kind and thoughtful."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're like the coffee you make... warm and brew-tiful."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, well, heh, thank you. I do try."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-2/c-6/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "W-Well... I've never received such a review before... haha. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But, you get what I mean, right?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I like to be more personable with the customers; that's the best kind of customer experience to me."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "The corporate nature always gets in the way of all of that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Heck, if it weren't for the customers, maybe I would've quit a long time ago."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Coffee is just... everything to me. The aroma, the flavor profiles, the warmth."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You feel that too, right?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Probably not as much as you, but I get it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Good... good..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/c-8/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm glad somebody around here does."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Yeah you're not a literal coffeemaker so I guess I win that one."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Sometimes it feels like I go cocoa crazy and nobody else really gets my obsession with this fabulous drink, especially with a boss like..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Look, I... I wasn't going to say anything while he was here, but... he's making new plans."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Plans that... I don't like."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What plans?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh oh."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-4/c-11/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Uh oh is right."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Roofbucks in their infinite wisdom... have decided to completely get rid of the customer experience."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "They want to turn us into... into a fast coffee business."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-5/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fast coffee?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-5/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But you love going slowly!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-5/c-13/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "They say the whole ordering system needs to be completely revamped to maximise profit."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Instead of warmly greeting customers like I normally would, now I'm expected to have 30 second interactions with them at the MOST to get their order..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "...and then mindlessly brew away."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No special touches, no conversations, nothing."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Coffee in, coffee out."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's like they don't want what they hired me for. Quality, and thoughtful coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/48
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "They just want me to take every customer interaction... every drink I make... make it all in an instant and then wrap it all up and throw it away in a disposable pod."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/56
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Apparently, \"somebody\" made a complaint about the times I've been chatting away... mainly to you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is all my fault."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna find that snitch and end them."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/c-14/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, honey, no, don't blame yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/c-15/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's not your fault at all... if anything, it's fully on me."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Whoa! Don't have to go that far!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I get it... I'm just probably not the corporate machine type... I care too much."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you ever thought about making coffee somewhere else?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/c-17/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "S-Somewhere else?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/c-17/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I... I guess I never thought of that before. I mean... I guess I do know a thing or two about my coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/c-17/23
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But... Roofbucks has a complete monopoly on the coffee business; there's nowhere else for me to go."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/c-17/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a literal coffeemaker. You don't need them."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-7/c-17/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Wow, I... I mean, it's a lot of work to make that happen. I wouldn't have any corporate backing or anything like that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Do I even have what it takes to make it?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have the returning customers."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have me."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-8/c-18/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You know what... you're right!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-8/c-19/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You know what... with your support, I guess I could do anything."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm the one making the coffee and seeing the customers day in, day out!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'll have to give this some thought, but... maybe I CAN do it. I'm a smart bean, I know I'll be able to figure this out."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-9/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a lot more confident now."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-9/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is going to be risky... but worth it."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-9/c-20/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "All thanks to you!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "If you hadn't encouraged me to step out on my own, I would have never been able to even think about this."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It'll take a lot of work, and honestly, still a lot of hours I need to do under Roofbucks to get stuff going, but... it's worth it to chase after my dreams."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_2/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Thank you... thank you so much."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Order up! I've got a Vietnamese iced coffee, soy frappuccino, and a Mexican iced mocha!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi seems far cheerier this time around, as busy as ever and calling out orders. She grins when she spots you, greeting you with a peppy wave."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Well, hello, hello, hello!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "If it isn't my favorite customer!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Business is pretty hectic today."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No corporate spiel today?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "No kidding! I haven't had this much business in ages!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But, hey, at least I'm doing things my way!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Wait.. no... didn't you hear?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Did... did nobody tell you?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Did I NOT tell you?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh my gosh... I can't believe this!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I do ALL of my marketing and it was all for nothing?! What a drag!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kopi. Short and sweet."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What is it Kopi?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh! Right, right, I'm sorry, rambling again."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Kopi sets her coffee implements down and gestures all around her, absolutely radiating pride."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I did it! I went and made my own cafe!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Welcome to my little slice of paradise!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Everything looks... the same."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Well... funny story about that."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It was kind of like mutiny. I still get to keep the space but I get to do things MY way."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But... once the others realised that Roofbucks had nobody else to be a barista... they started ordering under my own branding real fast."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It was kind of a whirlwind experience, but now I get to do things my way!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-2/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so happy for you!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-2/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That is awesome."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Right? I'm so stoked that I could finally make this a reality, and it's all thanks to you!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It just goes to show you... sometimes, red-lined policies aren't always the way. Sometimes, you have to bend them to get return business."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Now, bear in mind, bear in mind, I DO NOT have a name for this place yet."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "It's currently just... \"Hey, wanna get a coffee from Kopi?\""
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "At least, that's the word of mouth I'm hearing at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I don't really have a proper business name, but I'm workshopping some ideas!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Call it 'Kopi Burger!'"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Call it 'Kopicabana!'"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Call it 'The Bean ft. Kopi'"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll let you come up with something."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But... we don't serve burgers."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/c-8/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I think... no."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "That's a good idea."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Next time you come around, hopefully, I'll have something ready!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_open_3/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I seriously can't thank you enough for all of this... which, reminds me..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You've been one of my favorite customers, and, well, I don't get this close to just anybody."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I... I think I love you. Like, more than a friend way."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/16
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I... maybe it's too much to ask, and it's just wishful thinking on my part, but... I've been seeing the signs from you."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/24
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I think I'm ready to take this to the next step."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/32
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "The creamer to my coffee."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/40
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Do you think... we could be more than just barista and customer?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love you too!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it would be best if we just stayed friends."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I... r-really?"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh, gosh, I'm so glad..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Oh... I see."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_love_path/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm sorry if I misread something between us, but... I'm glad that we can at least stay friends."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/0
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You've been one of my favorite customers, and honestly? You're someone that I feel I can just have fun with!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/8
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "You're genuinely someone I would like to hang out with outside of a shop."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/19
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I can talk to you about pretty much anything, and you don't even bat an eye."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/27
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "Let's be more than barista and customer. Let's be friends!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That would be awesome."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping we could be more than just friends..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I knew you'd think so too!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "And this is why we're absolutely going to be best mates, I can feel it!"
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I'm... I'm sorry if you misread anything between us..."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "I don't really feel anything romantic towards you... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: kopi_coffee/kopi_true_friend_path/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Kopi"
msgid "But, hey, I think staying friends would be the best for us; like two platonic friends in coffee brewing!"
msgstr ""
